OL,3,GNEWSAMap shows if homes are suitable
OL,4,Afor solar panels
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn online map has been launched to help
OL,7,Fislanders understand how suitable their
OL,8,Fhomes are for solar panels.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said the map was
OL,11,Fcolour-coded to show the amount of
OL,12,Flight that solar panels would receive
OL,13,Fon the island's rooftops across the
OL,14,Fcourse of a year.
OL,16,FRoofs with higher potential to generate
OL,17,Felectricity through solar panels show
OL,18,Fas dark red, while roof spaces with
OL,19,Flower potential are coloured dark blue.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
