OL,3,GNEWSAMap shows if homes are suitable
OL,4,Afor solar panels
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Adrian Gabriel, said while
OL,7,Fislanders are encouraged to contact
OL,8,Fprofessionals when looking to install
OL,9,Fsolar panels, the map would be a
OL,10,F"really helpful tool to get an initial
OL,11,Fidea on whether the potential for solar
OL,12,Fis there for householders".
